msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-add.md:16
msgid ""
"Copy _path_ to the Nix store, and print the resulting store path on standard "
"output."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-add.md:19
msgid "**Warning**"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-store-add.md:21
msgid ""
"The resulting store path is not registered as a garbage collector root, so "
"it could be deleted before you have a chance to register it."
msgstr ""

